Parent: 1522

## Context
Child of tracker 1522. Lair step 11 is "no Zotero access, no network", so the
offer reads local state only.

## Design (MOE)
- Beside step 11, a trigger script compares the project's merged note drafts
  with publish-notes' local state file (1525) and prints
  "N merged notes not yet published: offer /zotero publish-notes" when drafts
  are ahead; no output otherwise. Proposal only, never run automatically, as
  for check-staging. No Zotero call, no network.

## Exit criteria
- [ ] lair offer for unpublished merged notes, with a test (drafts ahead ->
      one line; in step -> no output; no state file -> the count of all drafts)
